OL,3,AAsbestos 'nearly everywhere' after 9/11
OL,4,A- new documents reveal air-quality
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew York City Mayor Zohran Mamdani
OL,8,Freleased a tranche of 170,000 documents
OL,9,Fthat show officials had concerns about
OL,10,Fair quality in Manhattan soon after the
OL,11,F9/11 attacks, even as the public was
OL,12,Ftold the air was safe.
OL,14,FThe mayor said the documents reveal
OL,15,Fasbestos was found "nearly everywhere"
OL,16,Fthey tested near Ground Zero, the site
OL,17,Fwhere the World Trade Center towers
OL,18,Fcollapsed in 2001.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
