OL,3,AAsbestos 'nearly everywhere' after 9/11
OL,4,A- new documents reveal air-quality
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,F"People got sick because the leaders
OL,8,Fthey trusted lied and told them they
OL,9,Fwere safe to breathe in toxic air,"
OL,10,FMamdani said at a news conference with
OL,11,Fsurvivors.
OL,13,FIllnesses related to the dust and smoke
OL,14,Ffrom the collapse of the Twin Towers
OL,15,Fhave claimed more lives than the
OL,16,Fattacks themselves, US health officials
OL,17,Fsay.
